r quarantine/revocation is ignored. Emit Review-state table and explicit release gate/exception decision. Dependencies: PKG8, SAFE6. Criterion behavior/pkg9/generated-candidate-provenance: accept Record a generated candidate's generator identity and input hashes before any review/publish transition. Reject Generated candidates lack provenance or unreviewed generated source becomes implicitly trusted. Emit Generator/provenance record and PKG9005. Dependencies: PKG9, PKG10, A11. Criterion behavior/pkg9/latent-package-state: accept Track reserved/generated/review-requested/reviewed/published/rejected/revoked transitions; published resolves normally and other states require explicit grants and matching policy. Reject Latent names satisfy ordinary constraints or a candidate is published without its required reviewed transition. Emit Latent-state transition, access and publish decisions; PKG9004/PKG9006. Dependencies: PKG9, GOV10. Criterion behavior/pkg9/mirror-authenticity: accept Verify and preserve original registry signatures or emit a verifiable mirror attestation for mirrored content. Reject A mirror loses original signatures and cannot provide a verifying attestation. Emit Mirror state/attestation/verification record and PKG9007. Dependencies: PKG9, PKG12. Criterion behavior/pkg9/registry-access-privacy: accept Require private read authorization before returning metadata and produce public errors that do not reveal private package existence. Reject An ungranted principal reads private metadata or learns private existence from public resolution errors. Emit Privacy-safe access decision with registry/package/principal scope and PKG9001/PKG9002. Dependencies: PKG9, L15. Criterion behavior/pkg9/registry-history-retention: accept Retain yank/revocation records and identity/material required for policy-authorized reproducible historical builds. Reject Registry mutation erases retained historical rebuild evidence or silently hides revocation state. Emit Registry yank/revocation log, retained provenance and historical build decision. Dependencies: PKG9, PKG7, GOV10. Criterion behavior/pkg9/registry-index-verification: accept Verify registry indexes when signatures are required and record the registry source in every selected package lock record. Reject Required index signatures fail/are absent or a selected lock record omits its registry source. Emit Index signature/source verification and PKG9003/PKG9008. Dependencies: PKG9, PKG5, PKG12. Criterion behavior/pkg9/registry-publication-gate: accept Publish only with preserved provenance/safety metadata and the policy-required review/state transition. Reject A private/latent publish bypasses required review or loses safety/provenance metadata. Emit Publish/state/provenance decision and PKG9006. Dependencies: PKG9, PKG8, PKG10, GOV10."}
